                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.12155/436: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morrow</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-07-11T13:00:00-04:00">July 11, 1930—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>176. Your 140, July 9 noon. You are authorized to initiate negotiations with
                    Mexican Government relative to Rio Grande River rectification project when you
                    consider the moment propitious. Department is hopeful that an agreement may be
                    reached which will include a final settlement of Chamizal and other territorial
                    differences existing between the two countries in the region covered by the
                    rectification project.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
